  $('#privateAccessSubject').innerHTML='<option value="">Choose account or active guest…</option>'+grantable.sort((a,b)=>subjectLabel(a).localeCompare(subjectLabel(b),undefined,{sensitivity:'base'})).map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.type+':'+x.id)}">${esc(x.label||'Unnamed user')}${x.secondary?` · ${esc(x.secondary)}`:''} · ${x.type==='guest'?'Guest':'Account'}</option>`).join('');
  $('#loomAdminAccessCard')?.classList.toggle('hidden',!a.canViewLoomAdmins);
